-For a full parse artifact package, run one authoritative
-`inspect_manufacturing_hints_rdescriptor` call with every desired feature kind
-explicitly listed, then reuse its stable entity IDs for per-candidate
-`render_region_rpath` images and section planning. Compute each planned section
-with `inspect_section_rdescriptor(compact=False)` and pass the saved detailed
-descriptors to `render_sections_rpath`; the renderer consumes `samples_2d` and
