 | Failure | Required response |
 | --- | --- |
-| Target missing, invalid suffix, or unreadable BREP | Write failed Phase 1/2 status and stop; do not use screenshots as a substitute |
-| Output directory overlaps the target directory | Ask for an isolated absolute output directory and stop |
-| Authoritative report is truncated | Increase `max_hints`, replace the incomplete authoritative report, and rerun dependent phases |
